🤖 AI Chatbot: Question → Answer
Example: Bakery Chatbot 🍰

User asks a question:

“How can I increase my bakery sales?”

⬇️

AI Chatbot gives an answer:

“You can increase sales by promoting your bakery on Instagram, offering combo deals, and introducing loyalty discounts for regular customers.”

Simple flow
👤 User Question
      ↓
"How can I increase my bakery sales?"
      ↓
🤖 AI Chatbot
      ↓
💬 Gives an Answer
      ↓
"Use Instagram, combo offers, and loyalty discounts."
Another example
👤 Question:
"What are the benefits of digital marketing?"

        ↓

🤖 AI Chatbot

        ↓

💬 Answer:
